<title>AUSTRALIA: Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 11.</title>
<headline>Top 20 Australian Dividend Yields - June 11.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twenty highest dividend yields for Australian companies included in the 320-share All Ordinaries Index based on closing prices on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Dividends based on rolling 12 months.</p>
<p>Yields are not grossed up for franking credits.</p>
<p>				  Dividend</p>
<p>Rank Name		     Yield    Close</p>
<p> 1   Mt Leyshon Gold	13.16    1.90</p>
<p> 2   Cudgen R.Z.	     9.43    2.65</p>
<p> 3   Aust Tour		 9.38    0.80</p>
<p> 4   Prime Credit Tr	 9.14    1.07</p>
<p> 5   Prop Income Inv	 8.77    1.15</p>
<p> 6   Centro Prop	     8.67    2.22</p>
<p> 7   Indu Property	   8.58    0.99</p>
<p> 8   BT Prop Trust	   8.54    1.91</p>
<p> 9   Natl Consol	     8.41    1.07</p>
<p>10   Schroder Prop	   8.30    2.23</p>
<p>11   Colonial Mutual	 8.26    1.29</p>
<p>12   Ipoh			8.26    2.18</p>
<p>13   Equitilink		8.20    0.61</p>
<p>14   Gen Prop Tr	     8.17    2.46</p>
<p>15   Colonial Coml	   8.14    2.27</p>
<p>16   Countrywide-PP	  8.13    1.25</p>
